
== scale is preserved ==
1                                  scale 0
1.0                                scale 1
1.00                               scale 2
1.50                               scale 2
1.5                                scale 1
100                                scale 0
0                                  scale 0
0.00                               scale 2
0.0100                             scale 4
-2.50                              scale 2

== equality and ordering are numeric ==
1.50d == 1.5d                      true
1.50d ~= 1.5d                      false
0.00d == 0d                        true
rawequal(1.50d, 1.5d)              true
1.50d < 1.5d                       false
1.50d <= 1.5d                      true
1.50d >= 1.5d                      true
100d == 100.000d                   true
0.1d < 0.10001d                    true

== how operations treat scale ==
1.50d + 1.5d (larger scale)        3.00
1d + 0.001d                        1.001
1.5d - 0.50d                       1.00
1.5d * 2d (scales add)             3.0
1.50d * 2.0d                       3.000
0.1d * 0.1d                        0.01
2.50d * 1d                         2.50
5d - 5d                            0
5.00d - 5d (zero keeps scale)      0.00
0.00d + 1.5d                       1.50
-0.00d (no negative zero)          0.00

== normalizing when you want to ==
round(2.50d, 5)                    2.50
round(2.50d, 1)                    2.5
round(2.50d, 0)                    2

== equal values, different text ==
distinct strings for 1, 1.0, 1.00  1, 1.0, 1.00
all equal to each other            true
